__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Dictionary data stays out of git, and not just to keep the repo small: MOE releases 臺灣閩南語常用詞辭典
# under CC BY-ND, which forbids redistributing a derivative. The flattened lookup dictionary.py
# builds is exactly that. Downloading it per-machine at first run is what keeps us on the right
# side of the line -- committing a copy to skip the download might not.
*.json
*.txt
